{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re piecing together a starship from core to armoured titan, whatever junk your replicators can spit out. Engines that can push unevenly if you bolt them wrong. Weapons that definitely break a few treaties. Wings that are just triangles but hey, they look cool. It doesn\u2019t have to be pretty; it just has to fly. <br><br>This is a <strong>Modular Spaceship Project</strong> where every block you add changes how your ship handles, fights, and falls apart.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/d6c16c9ab3d8283778a09dd3b91fc88f.poster.avif?t=1762093856\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/d6c16c9ab3d8283778a09dd3b91fc88f.webm?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/d6c16c9ab3d8283778a09dd3b91fc88f.mp4?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and conquer\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids, because rocks don\u2019t shoot back. <strong>Blast enemy ships</strong>, because they got in your way. Now they\u2019re spare parts. Every battle earns you credits, wreckage, and new problems: a thruster that spins you out of control, <strong>a</strong> <strong>reactor that may or may not\u00a0 be on the edge to explode</strong>, or a cannon that\u2019s way too big for your frame (perfect).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/ab6db9f9cd420ba45e0a31e91ddfaa26.poster.avif?t=1762093856\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/ab6db9f9cd420ba45e0a31e91ddfaa26.webm?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/ab6db9f9cd420ba45e0a31e91ddfaa26.mp4?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone is a bullet-riddled puzzle. Survive them one by one, scavenging the bones of your enemies until your Franken-ship is a towering, awkward masterpiece. And when you finally stand alone, victorious and monstrous, remember: something out there is bigger, meaner, and much scarier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Fight. Survive.</strong><br>The galaxy isn\u2019t going to conquer itself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933370?t=1762093856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933370?t=1762093856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/a61c1f8aca4410f7ba0db7a8610223fdf8f5cffd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762093856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/a61c1f8aca4410f7ba0db7a8610223fdf8f5cffd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762093856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re piecing together a starship from core to armoured titan, whatever junk your replicators can spit out. Engines that can push unevenly if you bolt them wrong. Weapons that definitely break a few treaties. Wings that are just triangles but hey, they look cool. It doesn\u2019t have to be pretty; it just has to fly. <br><br>This is a <strong>Modular Spaceship Project</strong> where every block you add changes how your ship handles, fights, and falls apart.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/d6c16c9ab3d8283778a09dd3b91fc88f.poster.avif?t=1762093856\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/d6c16c9ab3d8283778a09dd3b91fc88f.webm?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/d6c16c9ab3d8283778a09dd3b91fc88f.mp4?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and conquer\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids, because rocks don\u2019t shoot back. <strong>Blast enemy ships</strong>, because they got in your way. Now they\u2019re spare parts. Every battle earns you credits, wreckage, and new problems: a thruster that spins you out of control, <strong>a</strong> <strong>reactor that may or may not\u00a0 be on the edge to explode</strong>, or a cannon that\u2019s way too big for your frame (perfect).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/ab6db9f9cd420ba45e0a31e91ddfaa26.poster.avif?t=1762093856\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/ab6db9f9cd420ba45e0a31e91ddfaa26.webm?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/extras/ab6db9f9cd420ba45e0a31e91ddfaa26.mp4?t=1762093856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone is a bullet-riddled puzzle. Survive them one by one, scavenging the bones of your enemies until your Franken-ship is a towering, awkward masterpiece. And when you finally stand alone, victorious and monstrous, remember: something out there is bigger, meaner, and much scarier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Fight. Survive.</strong><br>The galaxy isn\u2019t going to conquer itself.</p>","developers":["Declan Cullen"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933370/1a37fdb1b72fd31eae1edae59d57c97667b430a8/header.jpg?t=1762093856","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3933370/1821804258/0a93726a0fca6b7aada036a6bb84c6560a226035/1755366620/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755598352","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3933370/1821804258/0a93726a0fca6b7aada036a6bb84c6560a226035/1755366620/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755598352","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3933370/1821804258/0a93726a0fca6b7aada036a6bb84c6560a226035/1755366620/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755598352","id":257184208,"name":"Gameplay - Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184208/d9084c9c673f0871d699ebf4f6cc0d9228f4b5b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755598352"}],"name":"Modular Spaceship Project","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5GHZ +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows compatible sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>P